# One byte sequence everywhere. This repository's discipline is byte-exact
# artifacts verified by SHA-256, and the classic failure is a CRLF checkout
# silently changing a file's hash. Normalise on commit, check out LF on every
# platform, and never let the line ending become a variable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# binary, never touched
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.pt  binary
*.joblib binary
